  "notes": "Early pressing, pressed/glass mastered at WEA Olyphant.\nPackaging: standard jewel case housed in an outer card sleeve.\n\nHype sticker states that the enhanced portion \"features exclusive video, web links and more.\"\n\nAll tracks published by Words Ampersand Music (Warner Tamerlane Publishing Co., BMI) and You Want a Piece of This Music (Bug Music, ASCAP), except Tracks 1, 7, 11 published solely by Words Ampersand.\n\nRecorded at The Loft, Chicago\nAdditional recording at CRC and Soma E.M.S., Chicago\nMixed at Soma E.M.S.\nMastered at Abbey Road Studios, London\n\nManagement for TMM Chicago\nBooking for High Road Touring (North America, Pacific) and for GAA (Europe, UK)\nLegal for Pryor, Cashman, Sherman & Flynn NYC\nFinancial for RZO, NYC\n\nOuter card sleeve:\nNonesuch Records, a Warner Music Group company.\n℗ & © 2002 Nonesuch Records for the United States and WEA International Inc. for the world outside of the United States.\n\nDisc face:\n℗ 2002 Nonesuch Records, a Warner Music Group company.\nMade in the U.S.A. by WEA Manufacturing, Inc. An AOL Time Warner company.",
